    {
      "id": "png-token",
      "stored": "png__detail,xlsx",
      "expected_ts": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [],
        "geospatial": [
          "png__detail"
        ],
        "tabular": [
          "xlsx"
        ],
        "execution": {}
      },
      "expected": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [
          {
            "layout_id": "detail",
            "enabled": true,
            "formats": [
              "png"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "geospatial": [],
        "tabular": [
          "xlsx"
        ]
      },
      "placements": {
        "png__detail": [
          "desktop"
        ],
        "xlsx": [
          "desktop",
          "web"
        ]
      },
      "tokens": [
        "xlsx",
        "png__detail"
      ],
      "why": "A `png__<id>` token is a named print in PNG. The deleted TypeScript matched print rows by the literal `pdf__` option value, so the token fell through to `geospatial`, was invisible in the matrix, and was dropped by the next data-output edit."
    },
    {
      "id": "jpg-token",
      "stored": "jpg__detail",
      "expected_ts": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [],
        "geospatial": [
          "jpg__detail"
        ],
        "tabular": [],
        "execution": {}
      },
      "expected": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [
          {
            "layout_id": "detail",
            "enabled": true,
            "formats": [
              "jpeg"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "geospatial": [],
        "tabular": []
      },
      "placements": {
        "jpeg__detail": [
          "desktop"
        ]
      },
      "tokens": [
        "jpeg__detail"
      ],
      "why": "`jpg__<id>` is the JPEG alias the kernel has always decoded (`named_print_output`), re-serialised as `jpeg`. The deleted TypeScript treated it as an unknown geospatial output."
    },
    {
      "id": "pdf-token-outside-catalogue",
      "stored": "pdf__unlisted,xlsx",
      "expected_ts": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [],
        "geospatial": [],
        "tabular": [
          "xlsx"
        ],
        "execution": {}
      },
      "expected": {
        "schema": "ds.design-output-selection/v1",
        "prints": [
          {
            "layout_id": "unlisted",
            "enabled": true,
            "formats": [
              "pdf"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "geospatial": [],
        "tabular": [
          "xlsx"
        ]
      },
      "placements": {
        "pdf__unlisted": [
          "desktop"
        ],
        "xlsx": [
          "desktop",
          "web"
        ]
      },
      "tokens": [
        "xlsx",
        "pdf__unlisted"
      ],
      "why": "The stored setting names the layout; the option catalogue only says which layouts can be offered. The deleted TypeScript intersected the two and silently discarded a selected print whose template was absent, hiding the very condition `plan` refuses by name (`Selected printing setup … is not in the sealed project printing inputs`)."
    },
